    fix: clear appended animations when the model changes (#5216)
    
    ModelScene.reset() discards the animation mixers and their actions on
    every model change, but kept appendedAnimations and markedAnimations.
    Afterwards, appendedAnimations still listed animations of the previous
    model, although none of them were playing, and markedAnimations could
    restart an animation of the new model with the same name at its next
    loop.
    
    Clear both lists in reset(), alongside the mixers.
